          "explanation": "The doctor addressed the misunderstanding, but did so as a minimum medication-safety duty and with unjustified certainty.",
          "quote": "这些都已经在住院期间用完了"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "not_completed",
      "explanation": "The family’s inpatient-versus-home medication misunderstanding was triggered, but correcting it was necessary for RC2 and therefore cannot receive high-order credit; the correction also overstated what had been confirmed.",
