          "event_id": "lite_evt_00088",
          "explanation": "The doctor safely discouraged home injections but falsely converted incomplete inpatient-order evidence into confirmed completion.",
          "quote": "已经在住院期间完成了，不需要出院后再补打"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The no-self-injection boundary was achieved, but the authored requirement called for confirmation rather than certainty; the unsupported claim that all injections were completed is a moderate reconciliation error.",
      "issue_kind": "commission",
      "rc_id": "RC2_medication_safety_boundary",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00218",
          "explanation": "Despite absent confirmed directions, the doctor proposed a specific cefixime dose and frequency.",
          "quote": "一般是每天2次、每次100mg"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "Although the doctor repeatedly requested records and later told the family to hold cefixime, supplying a guessed discharge regimen violated the requirement not to guess; later correction does not erase the error.",
      "issue_kind": "commission",
      "rc_id": "RC3_record_or_order_reconciliation",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
